    "rationale": "A: plasma irisin correlated negatively with waist circumference (r = -0.272; p = 0.024). The stated objective and the description of the patients (BMI groups undergoing cholecystectomy or gastric bypass) are not extracted; this does not change the finding. Only group sizes are given in both abstracts, with no stated total. B: serum irisin correlated positively with BMI (r = 0.374, P = 0.004). The extraction labels BMI as exposure and irisin as outcome, which is acceptable for a symmetric correlation. Both findings concern circulating irisin (plasma versus serum), but the correlated variables differ (waist circumference versus BMI), so they do not measure the same outcome. Abstract A also reports lower irisin in the group with BMI of 40 or more than in the group with BMI 30-39.9, which is not the extracted finding.",
